<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">1 Phexroosa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Phexroosa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Phex</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Phexroosa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phexroosi Xaafida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Koyro Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaariya Phexroosi xaafida koyro kiitay, “Dooretida Xoossa Asata” geetetidi xeegetidaysatasinne Guutha Iisen pudeha baggan laaletida ammaniya asaasa. Ha kiitay xaafetida gaasoy, ammano gaason metoynne waayey gakida asaa minthethanaasa. Ha maxaafa xaafey, iya hayquwa, iya denduwa, iya nam7antho yuussaa odiya Yesuus Kiristoosa wongela qaala enta akeekisees. Yesuus Kiristoosa de7uwa leemiso oothi xeellidi, meto danda7an kanthana mela enta qofisees. Hessara gathidi, metoy enta ammanuwa paaceysanne Yesuus Kiristoosi qonciya gallas bessiya woyto enti ekanaw de7eysa hassaysees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xaafey, enti meto danda7ana mela minthethi simmidi, Kiristoosa kaalliya asati de7eysada enti daana mela qofisees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Sarotho <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay nuus immida atotetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Geeshshatethan duussu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:17">1:13—2:17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosa waayiya leemiso <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 2:18-25">2:18-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Meto wode ammaniya asa hanota <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 3:1-4:19">3:1—4:19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cimatasinne na7atethatas imetida zore <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Moyzo Sarotho <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Taani, Yesuus Kiristoosa hawaarey Phexroosi; Phanxoosan, Galatiyan, Qaphadooqan, Iiseninne Bitaanen betanchoda laaletidi de7iya Xoossay doorida, asaas ha dabdaabiya xaafas. <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Yesuus Kiristoosas hinte kiitetana melanne iya suuthan geeyana mela, Xoossaa Aaway ba kase eran dooridaysatasinne Geeshsha Ayyaanan geeyida, hintew aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay gido.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhayona Ufaysi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Yesuus Kiristoosa hayqope denthidi ba gita maarotethan nam7antho yeletethaanne dhayonna ufaysaa immida nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa Aaway, Xoossay galatetto. <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>Qassi Xoossay hintew dhayonna, iitonnanne buuqonna laata salon giigisis. <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>He laatay wode wursethan qoncanaw de7iya atotethas Xoossaa wolqan ammanon hintew naagetidi de7ees.<verse eid="1PE 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Ha77i guutha wodes hinte dumma dumma paacen un7etikoka hessan ufaytite. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>He paacey hintena gakiday, taman yeggin dhayiya worqafe hinte ammanoy aadhonne tuma gideysa bessanaasa. He paacetida ammanuwan Yesuus Kiristoosi qonciya wode galataa, bonchonne saba hinte ekana. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Hinte Yesuusa be7ibeeketa, shin iya siiqeta. Hinte ha77i iya be7iboonaba gidikoka, iya ammaneta. Qassi odan qoncisanaw danda7etonna ufaysaninne bonchon kumideta. <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>Hinte ammanon naagiya hinte shempuwa atotetha ekana.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Aadho keehatetha baggara hintew giigida ha atotethaaba nabeti eranaw gita koshshaninne naagon koydosona. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Entan de7iya Kiristoosa Ayyaanay iya waayabanne hessafe guye, yaana bonchuwaba kasetidi markatishe, awude woyko waanidi hananeeko akeekan pilgidosona. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Nabeti odida tinbitey bantaw gidonashin, hintew gideysa Xoossay hintew qoncisis. Ha77i asay hintew odida Wongela salope kiitetida Geeshsha Ayyaana wolqan hintew odidosona. Kiitanchotika hessa be7anaw amotidosona.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshshatethan De7ite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Hessa gisho, oosos hintena giigisite; hintena haarite. Yesuus Kiristoosi qonciya wode hinte ekana aadho keehatetha ufaysan naagite. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Xoossaa naytada iyaw kiitetite; hinte kase eronna oothida iita amuwa kaallopite. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Shin hintena xeegida Xoossay geeshshi gididaysada hinteka hinte duussa ubban geeshshi gidite. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Taani geeshshi gidida gisho hinteka geeshshi gidite” geetetidi xaafetis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Leewe 11:44-45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Asa som7o be7onna iya oosuwada pirdiya Xoossaa, “Nu Aawaw” gidi xeegiyaba gidiko, ha sa7aa imathatetha duussaa yashshan de7ite. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Hinte, hinte aawatape laattida pathonna de7uwape wozetidaysi, dhayiya biran woyko worqan gidonnaysa ereeta. <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>Borey woyko borsoy bayna dorsa suuthada al7o gidida Kiristoosa suuthan wozetideta. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Xoossay alamey medhetanaape kase Kiristoosa dooris, shin ha wursetha wodiyan Kiristoosi hinte gisho qoncis. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Hinte ammanoynne hinte ufaysay Xoossan gidana mela iya hayqope denthidi, bonchida Kiristoosa baggara Xoossan ammaneta.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Hinte tumatethaas kiitetidi hintenatethaa geeshshideta. Hinte issoy issuwa wozanape siiqeta, shin ha77ika tuma wozanape minthidi siiqite.<verse eid="1PE 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Hinte nam7antho yeletiday dhayiya zerethafe gidonashin, merinaw de7iya Xoossaa qaalan dhayonna kochaafe yeletideta. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Xoossaa qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Asi ubbay maata mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">iya boncho ubbay ciishsha mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Maatay melees, ciishshayka qoletees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa 40:6-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>Shin Godaa qaalay merinaw de7ees”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">yaagees. Hintew odetida Wongela qaalay haysa.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">De7o Shuchinne Geeshsha Dere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Hiza, iitatethi ubbaa, cimo ubbaa, cubbotethi qanaatenne zigirsi ubbaa hintefe diggite. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2-3"/>Goday keeha gideysa hinte eridi meezetidaysada ha77i yeletida guutha naytada hinte atotethan diccishe baanaw Xoossaa geeshsha qaala maatha ubba wode amotite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Maz 34:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:2-3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Asan boretidi Xoossan dooretida al7o gidida de7o shuchaa, Godaa Yesuusako shiiqite. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Hinte Ayyaana keethi keexetiya de7o shuchata. Hinte Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara Xoossaa ufaysiya ayyaana yarsho yarshiya geeshsha kahineta. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Heko, taani Xiyoone kataman godaa xaphuwa minthiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">dooretida, al7o shuchaa wothas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">iyan ammaniya oonika yeellatenna”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:6">yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Ha shuchay hintew ammaneysatas al7o, shin ammanonaysatas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Gimbeysati kadhidi ixida shuchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">godaa xaphuwa minthiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ubbaafe aadhiya shuchu gidis.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz 118:22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>Qassika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Ha shuchay ase dhubiya shuchinne ase kundisiya zaalla”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">yaagees. Enti hessas qaadetida gisho Xoossaa qaala kiitetonna ixidi dhubetidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa 8:14-15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Shin Xoossay dhumape malaalsiya ba poo7uwako hintena xeegiday, hinte iya lo77otetha haratas odanaw dooretida koche, kawo kahine, geeshsha derenne Xoossaa dumma dere.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Kessa 19:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20-21">Isa 43:20-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Zaare 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tito 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>Hinte kase Xoossaa dere gideketa, shin ha77i hinte iya dere. Hinte kase maarotethi demmibeketa, shin ha77i maarotethi demmideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hose 2:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossaa Asada De7ite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Ta ishato, hinte ha sa7an imathenne bete asi gididaysada hinte shempuwa oliya asho amope haakana mela taani hintena woossayis. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Ammanonna asay hintena iita oothiya asada zigirya wode Xoossay nuna be7anaw yaa gallas, enti hinte lo77o oosuwa be7idi Xoossaa galatana mela hintew lo77o de7oy de7o.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Godaa gisho gidi maatara de7iya asatas haaretite; ubbaafe bolla gidiya gisho kawuwasika haaretite. <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>Enti iita ootheyisata seeranawunne lo77o ootheyisata sabbanaw kawuwape kiitetida gisho deriya ayseysatas haaretite. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Hinte, hinte lo77o oosuwan eronna eeya asaa doona oythanaysi Xoossaa shene. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Xoossaa aylle gididi la77atethan de7itepe attishin, hinte la77atetha iita oosos kama oothopite. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Asa ubbaa bonchite; ammaniya asaa siiqite; Xoossaa yayyite; kawo bonchite.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosa Waaye Leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Aylleto lo77o godatasinne keeha godata xalaalas gidonashin, iitataska bonchon haaretite. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Asi Xoossaa gisho gidi bessonna waaye waayetiko Xoossay iya anjana. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Shin hinte nagara oothin hintena dechiya wode hinte danda7iko hintew ay galati de7ii? Shin lo77oba oothidi waaye danda7iko Xoossay hintena hessas anjana. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Xoossay hintena xeegiday hessa gishosa; Kiristoosi hintew waayetis; hinte iya kaallana mela, hintew leemiso gidis. <verse eid="1PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>I nagara oothibeenna; iya doonan wordoy bentibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa 53:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>Enti iya cayiya wode, zaaridi cayibeenna. Shin waaye ekishe xillo pirdiya Xoossaas ba pirda aggaagisipe attishin, mandibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Nuuni nagaras hayqidi xillotethas daana mela Kiristoosi ba ashuwan nu nagaraa masqaliya bolla tookis; hinte iya madunthan paxideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Kase hinte oge balidi dhayida dorsata mela, shin ha77i hinte shempuwa heemmeysakonne naageysako simmideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Azinabanne Machiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1-2"/>Hessadaka, macheto, hinte azinatape Xoossaa qaalas kiitetonaysati de7ikoka aykoka odetonashin, hinte yashshatethaanne hinte geeshsha de7uwa be7idi ammanana mela entaw haaretite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Qola 3:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Hinte, hinte huuphe pixoninne worqa alleeqon woyko lo77o ma7on hinte bolla asatethaa loyson gidopo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 Ximo 2:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Shin hinte wozanaa giddon de7iya yegelsatethay Xoossaa sinthan hintew daro al7o gididi dhayonna, ashkenne wopu gida ayyaana gido. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Xoossay immana gidaysa ammanida geeshsha maccasati beni wode banta azinatas haaretidi, bantana hessada daro loythidosona. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>Hessada Saara Abrahaame, “Ta godaw” yaagada xeegashe, iyaw kiitetasu; hinteka aykoka yayyonna lo77oba oothiko I nayta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Medhe 18:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Azinatoo, hinte macheti hintefe daaburancho medheta gideysa eridi, entana bonchite; hinte woosa dhubonna mela Xoossay immida de7uwa enti hintera issife laattiya gisho enta bonchite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Qola 3:19</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lo77o Oothidi Meto Eko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Wursethan, ubbay issi qofan de7ite. Issoy issuwas qadhetishe, ishada siiqetite; qassi issoy issuwas keehatanne ashketa gidite. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Iita gisho iita woyko cashsha gisho cayidi zaaropite; hessa aggidi, Xoossay hintew anjuwa immanaw hintena xeegida gisho anjite. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Ayis giiko, Geeshsha Maxaafay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“De7o doseynne lo77o wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">be7anaw koyey oona gidikoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ba inxarsan iitabaanne wordo odeteysa aggo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Maz 34:12-16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Iitabaa ootheysa aggidi lo77oba ootho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">sarotethaaka keehi koyonne kaallo.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Godaa ayfey xillotako xeellees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">qassi I ubba wode enta woosa hayzees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Shin Goday iitabaa ootheyisata ba hanqo som7uwan xeellees”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 3:12">yaagees.<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Hinte lo77oba oothanaw amotiko hintena qohanay oonee? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Hari attoshin, xillotetha gisho hinte waayetiko anjetidaysata. Asas yayyofitenne hirgofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Maato 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Isa 8:12-13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Kiristoosa hinte wozanan bonchitenne godayite. Xoossay hintew immida ufaysas gaaso oychiya oodeska zaaro immanaw ubba wode giigidi uttite, shin hessa ashketethaninne yashshan oothite. <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>Qassi Kiristoosan hinte de7iya lo77o de7uwa iitabaa oothidabaada, hintena cayiya asay zigiryaban yeellatana mela hinte kahay geeshshi gido. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Xoossay gidaba gidiko iitabaa oothida gisho waaye ekeysafe lo77oba oothida gisho waaye ekeysi lo77o. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Kiristoosi nuna Xoossaako shiishanaw baw xillo gididi de7ishe, nagaranchota gisho issi toho nagara ubbaas hayqis; I ba asatethan hayqis, shin ayyaanan paxis. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Qassi he ayyaanan I bidi qashon de7iya shempotas qaala odis. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>Nohey markabiya keexiya wode he shempoti Xoossaas kiitetonna ixidosona, shin Xoossay entana danda7i gam7is. Hospun asa xalaali markabiyan gelidi, dhayo haathaafe attidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Medhe 6:1—7:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>He dhayo haathay ha77i hintena ashshiya xinqate leemiso gidis. Ha xinqatey bolla qita meecco gidonashin, lo77o kaha Xoossaafe ekanaw iya woossiya oge gididi, Kiristoosa denduwa baggara hintena ashshees. <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>I salo bidi Xoossaa ushachan uttidi, kiitanchota, maata aawatanne wolqaamata haarees.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Ammaneta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Hessa gisho, Kiristoosi ba ashuwan nuus waayetida gisho hinteka he qofan hintena dancisidi minnidi eqite. Kiristoosa gisho gidi ba ashuwan waaye ekida uray nagara oothike gidi qanxida asi. <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>He uray ba attida laythan Xoossaa shene oothanaw koyeesipe attishin, iita asho amon deenna. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Kase hinte ammanonna asay de7idaysada de7ideta. Hinte iita amon, laymatethan, mathon, tunatethi denthethiya yethan, pokiya eeqa goyinnon kase de7ida duussay gidana. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Ammanonna asaara hinte shori bayna oosuwa oothonna gisho malaaletidi hintena cayoosona. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Shin enti paxata bollanne hayqida asaa bolla pirdanaw de7iya Xoossaas zaaro immana. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Hayqida asaas Wongelay sabbaketiday haysa gishosa. Enti asatho banta ashuwan pirdetana qassi banta ayyaanan Xoossaatho de7on daana.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Hiza, ubbabaas wursethay matatis. Hessa gisho, woossanaw danda7etana mela wopu gida wozani de7o; maarara de7ite. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Siiqoy daro nagara kammiya gisho, ubbaafe aathidi issoy issuwara wozanape siiqetite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Leemi 10:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Zuuzumonna issoy issuwa imathatethan mokite. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Hinte Xoossaafe dumma dumma aadho keehatetha imota ekidaysada hinte issoy issoy he imuwa bessiyada oykidi issoy issuwa haggaazite. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara ubbaban Xoossay galatetana mela oonika odiyaba gidiko Xoossaafe qaala ekidaada odo. Qassi oonika maaddiyaba gidiko Xoossay iyaw immiya wolqaada maaddo. Bonchoynne wolqi merinaape merina gakanaw iyaw gido. Amin7i.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammano Gaason Gakiya Waaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Ta ishato, hinte tamada xuuggiya waaye paaciya giddora aadhiya wode oorathabay hanidaada malaaletofite. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Shin iya bonchoy qonciya wode hinte ufaysay gita gidana mela Kiristoosa waayiya hinte ekeysan ufaytite. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Kiristoosa sunthaa gisho asi hintena cayiya wode, Xoossaa boncho Ayyaanay hinte bolla shempiya gisho hinte anjetidaysata. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Hintefe waaye ekiya oonika shempo wodhidaada woyko kaysotidaada woyko iita oothidaada woyko gelsonnaban gelidaada hanidi waayetofo. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Gidoshin, kiristaane gidiya gisho waayetiko Kiristoosa sunthaa gisho Xoossaa galatope attishin, yeellatopo.<verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Pirdi Xoossaa asaa bolla doomiya wodey gakis. Hiza, he pirday koyro nu bolla doomiyaba gidiko, Xoossaa Wongelas Kiitetonna asaa wursethay ay gidanee? <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>Xilloy un7an attiyaba gidiko, makallanchoynne nagaranchoy yaatin waananee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Leemi 11:31</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossa sheneda waaye ekeysati banta shempuwa bantana medhida, ammanthiya Xoossas hadara immishe lo77oba ootho.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Cimatasinne Na7atethatas Imetida Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Hiza, woosa keethaa cimatara cima gididaysi, Kiristoosa waayiya markateysinne qoncanaw de7iya bonchuwa shaaketanaw de7iya taani, hinte giddon de7iya cimata zorayis. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>Hinte aawatethafe garsan de7iya Xoossaa wudiya heemmite. Xoossay koyeysada dosanaape attishin, un7etidi heemmofite. Qassi miishe koshshan gidonashin, haggaazanaw de7iya lo77o qofan heemmite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Yoha 21:15-17</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Hinte aawatethafe garsan de7iya wudiyas leemiso giditepe attishin, godatopite. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Heemmeyisata halaqay qonciya wode qolettonna boncho kallacha hinte ekana.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Hessadaka, yalagato, cimatas haaretite. Hinte issoy issuwas ashke gidite. Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Xoossay otoranchota ixees, shin ashketas aadho keehatetha immees” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Leemi 3:34</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Xoossay ba wode hintena bonchana mela wolqaama Xoossaa kushiyape garsan hintena kawushite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Maato 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luqa 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>I hintew qopiya gisho hintena hirgisiya ubbaa iya bolla yeggite.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Hinte morkey Xalahey, mittiyaba koyidi, gaammoda gudishe hinte matara yuuyiya gisho hintena haaritenne barkite. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Alamen de7iya hinte ishati hessada waaye ekeysa eridi, ammanon minnidi, Xalahiyara eqetite. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Ba merinaa bonchuwas Kiristoos Yesuusa baggara hintena xeegida aadho keehatetha ubbaa Xoossay, guutha wodes hinte waayetidaape guye, I ba huuphen hintena shiishana, katisana, minthidi essana, xaalisana. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Merinaape merinaa gakanaw Xoossay kawoto. Amin7i.<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Ammanetida ishaa gada ta ekiya Sillaase baggara ha dabdaabiya hintew qanthan xaafas. Ta hessa hintew xaafiday, hintena zoranawunne Xoossaa aadho keehatethay tuma gideysa markatanaasa. He aadho keehatethan minnidi eqite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Hawa 15:22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Hintera issife dooretida Babiloonen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Babiloonen: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bessan Babiloone geetetiday Roome katamaa gidonna aggenna.</char></note> de7iya woosa keetha asaynne ta na7aa Marqoosi hintena, “Saro saro” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Hawa 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Qola 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filmo 24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Siiqo yeeretetha yeeretishe, issoy issuwa sarothite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Kiristoosan de7iya hinte ubbaas saroy gido. Amin7i.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
